  "rationale": "17 units of Cheese Slices 400G at Dark store 07 (South Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the online sell-by deadline on 2026-09-24; doing nothing writes off ₹3425 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹5546. This play uses a bundle with SKU-WHEAT-BREAD-400G at ₹295 for 315 consented customers (Personal care regulars, Sweets occasionals, Everyday staples shoppers, Tea connoisseurs, Premium Tea regulars, Household essentials buyers): expected 21 units, margin ₹591, discount cost ₹527, waste avoided ₹3425 (CI 1 to 61 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" This bundle play pairs the cheese slices with wheat bread at a bundle price of 295 INR, which satisfies the 8% dairy margin floor and is preferred over blanket markdowns by Kutumb Mart policy.",
